{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Sally's On-The-Job Training", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "What's the Best Way?", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 1, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 17, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A2.2", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Accurately use information about people's jobs and places of work in communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": " Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": " Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": " Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": " Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": " Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn5le17ob01re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Simple Past Tense (Irregular Verbs)", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "With <span class=\"strong\">regular </span> verbs, the rule is easy. The Simple Past tense always ends in <span class=\"strong\">-ed</span>:", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Base Form \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Simple Past Tense\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" finish \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"finished\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" stop \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"stopped\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" work \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"worked\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "But with <span class=\"strong\">irregular</span> verbs, there is no rule \u2026<br><br>Irregular verbs in the simple past tense don't end in <span class=\"strong\">-ed</span>. Read the chart below for some examples.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Sometimes the verb changes completely: \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" sing<br> buy <br>think\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" sang<br> bought <br>thought\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Sometimes there is no change:\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"cut<br> read<br>bet\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"cut<br> read<br>bet\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "I thought about comparing different strategies people use to balance professional life with their family responsibilities. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": " I wrote something similar a few years ago.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Asking for Somebody's Opinion", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " You can use the following phrases to ask for somebody's opinion:", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "What do you think about ... ? <br>What's your opinion on ... ? <br>Can I have your thoughts on ... ? <br>What's your take on \u2026 ?", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I could do a survey on ice cream. What do you think about that idea?", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "issue ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a printed document that is part of a collection, like a newspaper or a magazine ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: There are a couple of stories I'm thinking about for the next issue of Cambridge Life.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le17ob01aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when you talk about working for a magazine.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "work-life balance ", "type": "name"}, {"content": " placing equal importance on work and other aspects of life, such as family, friends and personal interests  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: One story is about work-life balance. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le17ob01aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "strategy", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a method; technique", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: I will compare different strategies people use to balance professional life with their family responsibilities. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le17ob01aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "story", "type": "name"}, {"content": "text containing factual information or opinion in a newspaper or magazine", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: There are a couple of stories I'm thinking about for the next issue of Cambridge Life.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le17ob01aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to maintain ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to continue to have; to keep up", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: I talked about how to maintain a social life when you start working.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le17ob01aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "the best way", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a method or technique that is superior to other options ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: What would be the best way to reach you?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le17ob01aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "journalism", "type": "name"}, {"content": " jobs in the field of communicating information to the public through newspaper, magazines, television, etc. ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: People work long hours in journalism. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le17ob01aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "healthcare ", "type": "name"}, {"content": " jobs related to the medical field (doctor, nurse, etc.) ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I think this issue is very important for people who work long hours, like in healthcare.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le17ob01aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Explain what work-life balance is to 5 people.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Ask them if they think this is an important issue for them.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Ask them about the strategies they use to maintain balance in their life.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write a list of the strategies you hear.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Present the list to your classmates.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I explain work-life balance.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I ask people's opinions on this topic.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write a list of strategies.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I present the list.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le17ob01re2aud01", "images": [{"image": "engenn5le17ob01re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "time": "0", "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn5le17ob01re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "time": "2000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Ms. Ryan</span>: Hello?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:  Good afternoon, Ms. a story I'm thinking about for the next issue.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ms.Ryan</span>: Great, what is it?"}, {"image": "engenn5le17ob01re2img05.jpg", "id": 2, "time": "14000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: It's about the best way to maintain work-life balance. I thought about comparing different strategies people use to balance professional life with their family responsibilities. I could ask people's opinions. What do you think about that idea?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ms. Ryan</span>: I think that's a great idea. I wrote something similar a few years ago. I talked about how to keep an active social life when you start working."}, {"image": "engenn5le17ob01re2img02.jpg", "id": 3, "time": "36000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I think this issue is very important for people who work long hours, like in healthcare.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ms. Ryan</span>: And also in journalism! <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Could I contact you if I have any questions over the weekend?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ms. Ryan</span>: Yes, absolutely.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Thanks. What would be the best way to reach you?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ms. Ryan</span>: You can send me an e-mail. I am always online.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Thanks, I really appreciate it."}], "coverimg": "engenn5le17ob01re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0], "template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can talk about jobs and work. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk or report about actions, events or people.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can ask for somebody's opinion.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " Do you work long hours?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What is the best way to maintain balance (work, family, friends, interests) in your life?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " Do you feel you have balance in your life?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct", "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "I have an opinion on that!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "type": "WL